    <title>EP26 健身半年汇报：猪瘾是真难杀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b710c4caaea1fb3b6f2916</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b710c4caaea1fb3b6f2916</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 20:19:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春暖花开，每年三月是最佳减重时期！你开动了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这也是三人健身小队半年成果主动汇报：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 瘦了，但不多</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 我承认我有猪瘾和手机瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 冷热知识：一杯400ml的拿铁的热量等于两小碗白米饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 「正常」饮食已经是高热量饮食了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> ”大量善良蔬菜减肥法“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 「干净饮食」与「肮脏饮食」的平衡的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 减脂增肌是一个“能量奢侈品”，需要腾出额外的心力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3878">01:04:38</a> 远离多巴胺的刺激，回归内啡肽的成就感。而内啡肽的全称叫【内源性类吗啡性物质】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4520">01:15:20</a> 下班后筋疲力尽，做几组力量训练令人放空</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵《The Lazy Song》 《I Ain't Worried》</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢欢迎来到好友聊天频道「亿点抱怨」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【生活中总是会有一些大小麻烦，欢迎和我们一起亿点抱怨。】</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify｜苹果podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 labgirls@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
